(text "Alinx ACKU15S SoM carrier (bom item 16): four Samtec ADM6-60-01.5-L-4-2-A-TR (240-pin, 4 x 60, 0.635 mm) - J1/J2/J4 on the FPGA sheet, J3 (power + config) here. J3 = +12 V feed (8 pins) + SelectMAP (unused; DONE -> FPGA_DONE) + BOOT_M0..2 straps + VCCAUX_PG -> SOM_PG + VCCIO_69/70/71 <- carrier v18. All MGT quads no-connect; GND tied. SoM is 80 x 80 mm; connector X/Y datum is the layout blocker (Alinx ACKU15S DXF/STEP needed - placeholder square in som_seed.kicad_pcb)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e43e56f4-554d-4a7e-881d-c8c7aa678d80"))
