(text "+12 V SoM feed (bom 17(d): 12 V switcher + heavy filter -> SoM only; planning figure 15 A / 180 W, user 2026-10-10). Board-to-board entry is Conn1/J506 SEAF: 30 V12SOM contacts (C2:C11, D2:D11, E2:E11) with a GND perimeter; separate J507/J508 terminals are removed. SoM takeoff = J3 x8 contacts (A1/A2/B1/B2/C1/C2/D1/D2): ~20 A at the ADM6 rating vs ~5-8 A for a KU15P-class load - 8 pins suffice. 2 x 220 uF polymer + 4 x 10 uF X7R kept here at J3 (the SoM connector end of the feed)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 455.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "47a6d2ef-7c5a-41f5-b82e-78def776745d"))
